<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><b style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font size="5">Congratulations on Your First Payroll</font></b></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font color="#006695" face="Calibri, sans-serif" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri;"><span style="font-size: 18.6667px;"><b><br></b></span></font><div style=""><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Congratulations! Your first payroll has been processed. Now that we’ve achieved that first big milestone together, I would like to acquaint you with some additional information that will be beneficial to you.</span><br><blockquote style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><blockquote style="margin: 0 0 0 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; margin: 0in; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">&nbsp;</span></p></blockquote></blockquote></blockquote><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><font color="#0563c1"><a href="http://portal.insperity.com/pcms/need_help">Need Help</a></font></span><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><a href="http://portal.insperity.com/pcms/need_help">:</a>&nbsp; Click on the hyperlink to navigate to our help page where you can access videos and quick tutorials designed to assist you with:</span><br><blockquote style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Symbol;">·</span><span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">Manage your employee’s information such as: compensation, job titles, classification, and processing employee terminations. Just click on an individual employee’s name to start making changes.</span></blockquote><blockquote style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><span style="color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Symbol;">·<span style="font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; font-family: Calibri;">&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;">Onboarding new employees: Setting up and managing your new employee paperwork is easy!&nbsp;</span></blockquote><blockquote style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri; margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px; border: none; padding: 0px;"><span style="font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;"><br></span></blockquote><span style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">As always, please feel free to reach out to me if there is anything else I can help you with.</span><div style=""><font face="Calibri, sans-serif" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Calibri;"><br></font><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left; margin: 0in;"><span style="color: black; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Thank you for choosing Insperity!</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left; margin: 0in;"><span style="color: black; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left; margin: 0in;"><span style="color: black; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Kind Regards,</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left; margin: 0in;"><span style="color: black; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Contact.Name}</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left; margin: 0in;"><span style="color: black; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Payroll Specialist</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left; margin: 0in;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Contact.NSP_Work_email__c}</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; text-align: left; margin: 0in;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Contact.NSP_Work_Phone__c}</span></p><p></p></div></div></div>]]></td>
